<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Shared package identity for all packable projects (core + dialect satellites).
       Inert for non-packable projects (tests, benchmarks). -->
  <PropertyGroup Label="Packaging">
    <Version>1.8.0</Version>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
New: ReadGrouped&lt;TParent, TChild, TKey&gt;() for one-to-many joins; WithTransaction() / WithoutTransaction().

BEHAVIOUR CHANGE (PostgreSQL): a run no longer opens an explicit transaction by default. PostgreSQL already executes a batch as one implicit transaction, so BEGIN/COMMIT added two round-trips and no atomicity. Batches remain all-or-nothing; reads are ~45% faster. SQL Server and SQLite are unchanged.

BREAKING (PostgreSQL): setting an isolation level now throws unless you also call WithTransaction(), because a level cannot be applied to a run that opens no transaction. One-line fix; the exception says so.

Full notes: https://github.com/purelogictek-inc/DapperPipeline/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Authors>PureLogicTek, Inc.</Authors>
    <Company>PureLogicTek, Inc.</Company>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 PureLogicTek, Inc.</Copyright>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/purelogictek-inc/DapperPipeline</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/purelogictek-inc/DapperPipeline</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup Label="Packaging">
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)assets/icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" Visible="false" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
